window.products.push({"id":853013,"name":"Navaris 14 Inch Round Cordierite Pizza Stone - XXL Baking Stone for BBQ Grill Oven for Homemade Crispy Crust Pizza, Bread, Cheese - Incl. Recipe Book","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f9fp8qGgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Bake and serve your own artisan pizza with the Navaris XXL Cordierite Pizza Stone. The cordierite material withstands extreme temperatures and absorbs excess liquid, leaving you with that crunchy taste. BEAUTIFUL SERVING PLATE Serve the pizza directly from the oven by using the stone baking tray as a serving plate. The stone plate is also great for serving cheese platters and appetizers or for baking cake, bread or rolls. The possibilities are endless! Serve the pizza directly from the oven by using the stone baking tray as a serving plate. The stone plate is also great for serving cheese platters and appetizers or for baking cake, bread or rolls. The possibilities are endless! HOW TO BAKE Before using the pizza stone for the first time, wipe the baking stone with a damp cloth. Preheat the oven to 450 degrees for about 30 minutes. The actual baking time is very short. Do not place the stone directly on a metal baking tray or on the bottom of the oven. Before you place the dough on the flat stone, you should either place baking paper or sprinkle the stone plate with flour. Before using the pizza stone for the first time, wipe the baking stone with a damp cloth. Preheat the oven to 450 degrees for about 30 minutes. The actual baking time is very short. Do not place the stone directly on a metal baking tray or on the bottom of the oven. Before you place the dough on the flat stone, you should either place baking paper or sprinkle the stone plate with flour. NOTE Not dishwasher safe. After baking, let the stone plate cool down. Do not rinse immediately with cold water, otherwise the pizza stone tray could break. Not dishwasher safe. After baking, let the stone plate cool down. Do not rinse immediately with cold water, otherwise the pizza stone tray could break. SPECIFICATIONS Material: cordierite Material: cordierite Size: 13.8\" x 0.6\" (35 cm x 1.5 cm) Size: 13.8\" x 0.6\" (35 cm x 1.5 cm) Weight: 8 lbs (3.63 kg) Weight: 8 lbs (3.63 kg) Shape: round Shape: round Temperature resistant up to 1,472°F (800°C) Temperature resistant up to 1,472°F (800°C) SCOPE OF DELIVERY 1x cordierite pizza stone XXL 1x cordierite pizza stone XXL 1x recipe book 1x recipe book","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f9fp8qGgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Navaris","source_asin":"B07LH8LJPR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LH8LJPR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LH8LJPR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
