window.products.push({"id":853194,"name":"Welhome Relaxed Cotton Linen Solid Bedding Everyday Oversize Quilt | Full/Queen | Fawn Brown | 96\" x 96\" | Luxurious Supersoft Bedspread | Superior Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fdiqbMfSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY STYLISH DESIGN as you can choose from a range of color options for versatility or fashionable pops of color. Designed for everyday use, all seasons and to compliment any existing decor. The linen and cotton will add a look of soft luxury to your home while the classic square quilting pattern allows for a relaxed feel. Pair or gift with the Relax Linen Quilt, Relax Duvet Cover Set and the 230TC Washed Solid Organic Sheet Set by Welhome to complete the look. Each sold separately. SLEEP WELL with a natural comfort that includes a 100% Linen face and 100% Cotton Reverse. Our mixed natural fiber quilted sham features a garment washed linen, cotton percale in a 180-thread count. This percale weave delivers a crisp and cool texture that is soft to the touch and durable. Linen is not only luxuriously soft but uses less water during production making it a sustainable, earth-friendly fiber. Good for you and the planet. MUST HAVE FEATURES to update a space into a sleep sanctuary. Our quilted shams were made to last for frequent washing and remain durable while getting even softer over time. Linen also includes anti-static and moisture-wicking properties that helps wick away and absorb moisture that naturally falls away while you sleep. Plus, the Quilted sham fill is crafted with a lightweight 150 GSM, 80% Cotton blended with 20% Polyester for breathability and a touch of warmth. QUALITY MATERIAL AND EASY CARE, standard machine washable, soft and breathable, lightweight cotton perfectly paired with linen. Machine wash cold, normal cycle. Wash dark colors separately, do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Do not iron. Do not dry clean. Full/Queen includes: 1 Quilt (96in x 96in). King/Cal-King includes: 1 Quilt (114in x 96n). DESIGNED WITH CARE, our packaging is made using sustainable PEVA, a less toxic alternative to vinyl that can cause a cloudiness in its overall color structure and is chlorine and phthalate-free. Our products are made using environmentally sustainable farming practices and water saving technologies. We care about the environment and guarantee our manufacturing is leading the way to a better tomorrow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fdiqbMfSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welhome","source_asin":"B09PTVQMB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PTVQMB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PTVQMB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
