window.products.push({"id":853196,"name":"WingIts Floating Double Shelves - Forza C Floating Shelf 17\" x 13\" x 14\" - for Bedroom, Bathroom, Kitchen (Holds Up to 40lbs!) [FASTENERS NOT INCLUDED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417qBBQZ9pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This floating double (C) shelf is very well made by one of the top manufacturers in the country, WingIts. The shelf is 2\" thick and the back is about 1/2 inch thick. The construction is made out of hardwood and a high quality white Italian MICA laminate. Doesn't scratch easily and is super simple to clean. BEDROOM: This double floating shelf works very well as a modern and contemporary bedside shelf replacing the bulky nightstand or night table. It takes up less space, floats on the wall and sits flush against it, creating a very contemporary and modern look to your bedroom. This is a two set and works great on both sides of a Queen or King or next to two twins. BATHROOMS: In Hotels this is often used in sauna, locker room and bathroom to hold towels, toilet paper and toiletries. This is great as an over the toilet shelf. KITCHEN: This works very well as a floating shelf over the counter tops in a kitchen to hold glasses and dinnerware, cookware or your spices. CLOSET: Great for extra shelving in your closet! Wingits designs and manufactures a quality line of products for Inns and Hotels across America, now you can add that level of class and style to your home. Specs: Uni-Body hardwood core/shelvThe FORZA - Floating “C”Shelf incorporates a large backplate that is mounted to the wall with your choice of fasteners. Works with any hollow fastening system. Fastening hardware is NOT included, you can pick your favorite fastener up at any local hardware store. (If your fastening to hollow drywall make sure to get hollow fastening system like the MAW35 WINGITS Fasteners. If drilling into studs or other hardwood no need for a hollow fastening system. A single small set screw (included)(bottom) secures so it cannot be removed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417qBBQZ9pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WingIts","source_asin":"B07H56J5GM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H56J5GM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H56J5GM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
