window.products.push({"id":853228,"name":"Torque Activated Pressure Sensitive Seals Cap Liners - 18 mm (0.71\") -100 PCS -Made in USA- for Glass & Plastic Bottles & Containers - No Induction Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yJWeCMjUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These polystyrene botlle and jar foam liner seals coated with torque-activated adhesive require no tools and no heat induction equipment. For proper application consider the following recommendations: ● Make sure your pressure sensitive liner size matches the bottle or jar opening.  These 18 mm (0.71 inches) seals are to be used with any bottles or jars that use 18 mm caps ● Completely clean the jar top with clean cloth and alcohol to clear of liquid  and/or solids. Center jar seal on top of you plastic or glass bottle or jar, and apply. The white  side of the seal shall be facing down, the side with red letters shall be facing up. ● Screw metal or plastic cap on bottle. Make sure the liner and cap are tightly secured on the container. ● Once the cap is applied, it should not be removed for at least 24 hours to ensure proper adhesion. Although depending on your application, the adhesion process might take significantly less time. ● Seals can be used with glass and plastic bottles or jars and with lined or unlined caps. These pressure sensitive liners are best for use with powder or dry products . ● Avoid overfilling your containers! ● Once seal is removed, it cannot be reapplied. ● Not suitable for applications containing oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yJWeCMjUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Advanced Girl","source_asin":"B07VSC4BS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VSC4BS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VSC4BS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
