window.products.push({"id":853396,"name":"REDECKER Natural Pig Bristle Espresso Maker Brush with Oiled Thermowood Handle, 8-1/8-Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814F0Ra-sNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relish the world-renowned quality of Redecker's handmade household products! The Redecker Natural Pig Bristle Espresso Maker Brush effortlessly cleans the crannies of even the most complex coffee machines. Stiff, natural pig bristles gently-yet-thoroughly clean away crumbs and coffee grounds, while its small size allows it to access even hard-to-reach niches. The skinny, thermowood handle provides additional reach. Before becoming a brush, Redecker's pig bristles are washed, scoured and combed in a thorough, multi-stage cleaning process. Redecker's proprietary finishing treatment guarantees exceptional quality, optimizing each material's inherent benefits. The Redecker Natural Pig Bristle Espresso Maker Brush measures 8-1/8-inches long. If dirtied, rinse with lukewarm water and a mild soap solution, towel blot to remove excess moisture, and hang dry with bristles down to prevent handle damage. The first handcrafted Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes were produced in 1935. A lot has changed since then. Today, the name Bürstenhaus Redecker stands as it has for many years for an ideal combination of natural quality, function and design. It lives from the blend of inventiveness, sound craftsmanship and creativity. Handcrafted in Germany, Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes are made of domestic woods, bristles, hair, and plant fibers, and have been for decades. Precedence is given to natural, sustainable raw materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814F0Ra-sNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REDECKER","source_asin":"B09K7SB5WM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7SB5WM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7SB5WM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
