window.products.push({"id":853660,"name":"My Life My Shop Refresh Flavor Infusing Beverage Flask - Double Walled Insulation, BPA Free - 16oz/450 mL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PQ+RJ8rAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everyone knows drinking water is good for you, but it can be boring. The My Life My Shop Refresh Flavor Infusing Flask is an easy way to make drinking your 8 glasses a day a lot more interesting, especially if you’re on the go. Double walled vacuum insulation keeps your drink cold (or hot) for up to 10 hours, and high quality, food grade stainless steel ensures that there’s no metallic aftertaste. But what makes the My Life My Shop Refresh Flavor Infusing Flask so special is the removable infuser basket. Made of durable, 100% BPA free Tritan plastic, you can load up the infuser with your favorite fruits and/or herbs – strawberries, cucumbers, grapefruit, melon, mint or basil, etc. – to curb cravings and stay hydrated by way of delicious enhanced water that’s free of calories and artificial sweeteners. Because the basket is removable, the My Life My Shop Refresh Flavor Infusing Flask can be used for other beverages besides water – use it for hot or iced coffee, tea, soup, alcoholic beverages, or even milk. The flask is corrosion and rust-resistant so it’s suitable for milk, citrus or acidic fruits and vegetables, or carbonated beverages. The wide-mouth top is large enough for most ice cubes, and the silicone seal prevents leaking. It has a non-slip bottom and fits in most car cup holders, and holds just under 16oz/450mL. How to Use My Life My Shop Refresh Flavor Infusing Flask Wash with mild soap and warm water before you use the My Life My Shop Refresh Flavor Infusing Flask for the first time. Do NOT put it in the dishwasher – it must be hand washed each time. Turn the removable infuser basket counterclockwise to remove it from the flask. Fill the bottle with hot or cold liquid of your choice, and fill the basket with your favorite ingredients before reattaching it to the lid. Replace the lid to the My Life My Shop Refresh Flavor Infusing Flask and gently shake the bottle to infuse the flavors. Enjoy! Because the My Life Shop Refresh Flavor Infusing Flask keeps liquids hot even after several hours, it is recommended that you don’t drink hot beverages directly from the flask, and instead pour into a cup. Do not fill the flask past the indicated maximum fill line to avoid overflowing and leaking. Do not put in the dishwasher, and never use in the microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PQ+RJ8rAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My Life My Shop","source_asin":"B07BMTZ4C2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BMTZ4C2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BMTZ4C2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":853661,"name":"Rechargeable Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, Refillable Spice Automatic Mill Shakers Set with Dual Charging Tray, Adjustable Coarseness & LED Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vt4YG4iTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Automatic One Hand Operation】The high-quality salt and pepper grinder electronic is battery operated and incredibly easy to use with its smart one-hand design so you can have fresh ground spices with just one push of a button. ✅【Unique Design】You will have NO chance to leave any finger print on the smooth matte black body.And there is a small clear round plastic window that unscrews and it's pretty good size so it's easy to fill and also to see when the grinder needs to be refilled. ✅【Wide Applicability】The electric grinder is suitable for pepper, salt and other solid grain seasonings. Battery powered, convenient and fast, you can use it anytime and anywhere. This grinder is the good helper for kitchens, restaurants, parties and outdoor picnics. ✅【Adjustable Grinder】 Our rechargeable electric spice grinder is ideal for salt, pepper and spices and provides optimal grain size from very fine to very coarse.What's more, the ceramic ginder design keeps the origin flavor of spice well. ✅ 【100% Satisfaction Guaranteed】 We recommend that you get this pepper grinder charged for 1 hour the first time you use. If it doesn't work, please contact to us to have an free replacement. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vt4YG4iTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"syschotech","source_asin":"B0BLYYS1ZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLYYS1ZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLYYS1ZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
