window.products.push({"id":853687,"name":"Flexible Molds - Western - Cowboy Hat, Cowboy Boot, Cactus, Sheriff Badge (4 cavity) - Cream Cheese Mint Molds - Candy Melts - Fondant - Caramels - So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tI2Gv5EVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"-- 4 Designs - Western - Cowboy Hat, Cowboy Boot, Cactus, Sheriff Badge--Edelaines Flexible Molds are made for Soft Candies like - Cream Cheese Mints - Candy Melts - Chocolate - Fondant - Gummies - Caramels - Fat Bombs Soft Candies require a flexible mold to easily remove the candy from the mold. Our molds are perfect for these types of candies. Molds are made from a medical-grade polymer which is food safe. This polymer allows the mold to remain flexible and easy to use, unlike silicone molds which tend to be more rigid. We recommend hand washing with mild soap and pat dry for years and years of use. Dishwasher is not recommended due to the higher drying temperatures. --Not Recommended for Microwave Use --Caution for years of use never put any product that is over 245° Fahrenheit into the flexible mold. Candies that are NOT suitable for our molds are hard candies, rock candy, and any candy that exceeds the 245° Fahrenheit limitation. Please note hard candies require temperatures of 300° Fahrenheit making them unsuitable for our molds. Made in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tI2Gv5EVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EDELAINE’S","source_asin":"B083RKLD9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083RKLD9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083RKLD9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":853688,"name":"Miyabi Koh 9.5\" Slicing Knife,Black/Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610iciWooUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each elegant MIYABI Koh knife is crafted in Seki, Japan. There, MIYABI artisans merge rich Japanese tradition with expert German engineering and state-of-the-art steels to produce these ultimate kitchen knives.Advanced FC61 fine carbide stainless steel - 61 hardness on the Rockwell scale - provides unsurpassed corrosion and chip resistance. This cutting-edge steel ensures the hand-honed blades retain their impressive sharpness for a long time. Thanks to an innovative, ice-hardened process, the FRIODURx2 blades offer remarkable durability, sharpness, and cutting performance.The stunning blades are finished with a true katana edge, homage to the samurai swords made in Seki centuries ago, and feature an embossed MIYABI logo. Stylishly stamped with a silver mosaic pin, the exquisite octagon-shaped handle feels as good as it looks. The Pakkawood handle supports both Western chopping and Asian rocking cuts - experience ergonomic perfection with each slice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610iciWooUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIYABI","source_asin":"B07DCYGP22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-853688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DCYGP22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DCYGP22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
